      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Chef Viktor Barinov proudly shows his daughter Katya around his new office at the Italian restaurant Arcobaleno. Katya casually asks her father to hire her, sparking a prickly family argument about why neither of them stayed in touch over the past year.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
